  areas="Common delivery areas are Andheri, Goregaon, Malad, Kandivali, Borivali, Mira Road, Powai, Ghatkopar, Kurla, Chembur, Thane West, Ghodbunder Road, Kalyan, Kharghar, Vashi and Panvel.",
