        ("Do you handle railway and bank transfer moves to Kolkata?","Yes. Where an IBA-approved mover is needed, the move is arranged through our IBA-approved partner (code MUK-2068), and you receive an itemised GST invoice, the signed inventory list and the lorry receipt for the claim."),
